     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hi Daniel,<div><br></div><div>Thanks a lot for this. Good point about standardizing, I usually do this for my ’secr’ models, so not sure why I overlooked that. I did as you say, and standardized and the model appears to be running. Thank you very much.</div><div><br></div><div>Will report back if it fails for some reason.</div><div><br></div><div>I’ll also go to km in my next run.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Clayton<br><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
